  "solutionMarkdown": "Let the two numbers be $3x$ and $5x$. According to the problem, their sum is given as:\n$$ 3x + 5x = 128 $$\nThis simplifies to:\n$$ 8x = 128 \\implies x = \\frac{128}{8} = 16. $$\nThe smaller number is $3x$, so we calculate it as follows:\n$$ 3 \\times 16 = 48. $$",
